{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばちは\n \n \n 佐々木久美です。\n \n \n 昨日は走り出す瞬間ツアー2018\n 国際フォーラムでのライブでしたー！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1WBZ53D3BSGR5KXR05T1GD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n けやき坂のファンの方々は本当に最高ですね😢\n 優しい楽しい！私もたくさん汗かきました！（笑）\n \n ありがとうございました💎\n \n 次はお久しぶりの大阪です。\n 楽しみやでさ〜\n \n \n \n 少し前ですが、\n 6月2日の握手会の写真を載せます！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1WC06GRCNX1VKPWQX5KV4K","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 新種のひらがなポーズです。\n 真似してもいいよ〜🎃\n 幼虫の卵ネックレスがポイントです。\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1WC16B5JQY9VXHV1Z281QJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n トップス変えて夏感が出ました🌞\n 前髪も少し変えてみました。\n いつか前髪流すの夢です\n \n \n なっちょがね、\n たくさん写真撮ってくれたよ〜\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1WC28NSRJ7BV552EFMFZ3N","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1WC3AXTXDE8RFYN93H15F4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1WC4CAR491TB80P5MTK6XH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 喜んでる〜（あゆみの母の台詞）\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1WC5DBSXEZQ4GYA1ZQBC1S","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1WC6F9RPQMMRJY55VYR0Z9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1WC7KEY6Y2Z4S99JGX7HTQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1WC8NCK9Q2MTYTVNWGMQ8H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n いつも素敵なお花をありがとうございます🌷\n \n \n \n \n \n \n 気がつけばアルバムの発売まで\n あと6日です！！！！！\n \n 特設サイトで全曲試聴が\n できるようになったので\n 是非チェックして、\n あと6日、ドキドキして待ちましょう💓\n \n \n \n そして、個別握手会の応募もまだまだできます！\n 幕張は完売したみたいです\n ありがとうございます。\n \n 大阪と名古屋はまだあるので\n 会いに来てくださると嬉しいです🦒\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1WC9R4PAHBQ7WR3Y2R62YH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n \n 佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"}